{"id":"b1c35d55817857e5","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-ipc-proof-system.md","title":"Intuitionistic Natural Deduction","display":"df-ipc-proof-system — Intuitionistic Natural Deduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-ipc-proof-system","aliases":["89-df-ipc-proof-system"],"display":"df-ipc-proof-system — Intuitionistic Natural Deduction","depends_on":["[[89-df-ipc-language]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-ipc-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-ipc-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ipc-proof-system — Intuitionistic Natural Deduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2804e12c027228d4\" href=\"?note=2804e12c027228d4\" title=\"89-df-ipc-language\">89-df-ipc-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}})\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}})\\)</span>。规则内的上下文取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的元素；最后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\)</span> 允许任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathcal S=\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span>；规则是有限前提判断集和单一结论判断的有序对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ipc\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{(\\varnothing,(\\Gamma,A))\\mid \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,A))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A),(\\Delta,B)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,A\\land B))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\land B)\\},(\\Gamma,C))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\\ C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,C)\\},(\\Gamma,A\\lor B))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\\ C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\lor B),(\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\},C),(\\Theta\\cup\\{B\\},C)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta\\cup\\Theta,C))\\mid\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},B)\\},(\\Gamma,A\\to B))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\to B),(\\Delta,A)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,B))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\bot)\\},(\\Gamma,A))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\},\\\\\nD_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\nD_{n+1}\\coloneqq D_n\\cup\\{s\\in\\mathcal S\\mid\\exists\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal S)\\ ((\\Pi,s)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\land\\Pi\\subseteq D_n)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ ((\\Gamma_0,A)\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ipc\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{(\\varnothing,(\\Gamma,A))\\mid \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,A))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A),(\\Delta,B)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,A\\land B))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\land B)\\},(\\Gamma,C))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\\ C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,C)\\},(\\Gamma,A\\lor B))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\\ C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\lor B),(\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\},C),(\\Theta\\cup\\{B\\},C)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta\\cup\\Theta,C))\\mid\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},B)\\},(\\Gamma,A\\to B))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\to B),(\\Delta,A)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,B))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\bot)\\},(\\Gamma,A))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\},\\\\\nD_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\nD_{n+1}\\coloneqq D_n\\cup\\{s\\in\\mathcal S\\mid\\exists\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal S)\\ ((\\Pi,s)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\land\\Pi\\subseteq D_n)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ ((\\Gamma_0,A)\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅给出直觉主义自然演绎；没有排中律、双重否定消去或经典反证规则。任意上下文的可推导性由有限子上下文解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-ipc-language","status":"resolved","id":"2804e12c027228d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-ipc-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S=\\mathcal C\\times\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ipc\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{(\\varnothing,(\\Gamma,A))\\mid \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,A))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A),(\\Delta,B)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,A\\land B))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\land B)\\},(\\Gamma,C))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\\ C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,C)\\},(\\Gamma,A\\lor B))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\\ C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\lor B),(\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\},C),(\\Theta\\cup\\{B\\},C)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta\\cup\\Theta,C))\\mid\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},B)\\},(\\Gamma,A\\to B))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,A\\to B),(\\Delta,A)\\},(\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta,B))\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\bot)\\},(\\Gamma,A))\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal C,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\},\\\\\nD_0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\nD_{n+1}\\coloneqq D_n\\cup\\{s\\in\\mathcal S\\mid\\exists\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal S)\\ ((\\Pi,s)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\land\\Pi\\subseteq D_n)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ ((\\Gamma_0,A)\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2536,"backlinks":[{"id":"f12af111ab11110d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A$ is the natural-deduction derivability\nrelation generated by [[89-df-ipc-proof-system]]."},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-ipc-language]]、[[89-df-ipc-proof-system]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-ipc-proof-system]]"}],"outgoing":["2804e12c027228d4","0d71e87a2f416230"]}